  "title": "24 March 1963: Live: Empire Theatre, Liverpool",
  "date": "1963-03-24",
  "content": "<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1\"><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p>A triumphant homecoming show for The Beatles, who gave a performance at the Empire Theatre. It was their first performance in the city in over a month, and came in the same week their debut album <a href=\"/albums/please-please-me/\">Please Please Me</a> was released. <span id=\"more-3707\"></span></p><div data-carousel-extra=\"{&quot;blog_id&quot;:1,&quot;permalink&quot;:&quot;https://www.beatlesbible.com/1963/03/24/live-empire-theatre-liverpool-5/&quot;}\" id=\"gallery-1\" class=\"gallery galleryid-3707 gallery-columns-3 gallery-size-thumbnail\"><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/live/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire-poster_01/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"98\" height=\"200\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire-poster_01-98x200.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"Poster for The Beatles at the Empire Theatre, Liverpool, 24 March 1963\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire-poster_01-98x200.jpg 98w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire-poster_01-284x580.jpg 284w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire-poster_01.jpg 313w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 98px) 100vw, 98px\" data-attachment-id=\"28388\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/live/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire-poster_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire-poster_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"313,640\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Poster for The Beatles at the Empire Theatre, Liverpool, 24 March 1963\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire-poster_01.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1963-photos/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_02/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"196\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_02-200x196.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles at the Empire Theatre, Liverpool, 24 March 1963\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_02-200x196.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_02-580x568.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_02-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_02.jpg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"28394\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1963-photos/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_02/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_02.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"640,627\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles at the Empire Theatre, Liverpool, 24 March 1963\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_02.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure><figure class=\"gallery-item\"><div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\">\n<a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1963-photos/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_01/\"><img decoding=\"sync\" width=\"200\" height=\"196\" src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_01-200x196.jpg\" class=\"attachment-thumbnail size-thumbnail\" alt=\"The Beatles at the Empire Theatre, Liverpool, 24 March 1963\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_01-200x196.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_01-580x568.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_01-66x66.jpg 66w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_01.jpg 639w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" data-attachment-id=\"28395\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/1963-photos/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_01/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_01.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"639,626\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"The Beatles at the Empire Theatre, Liverpool, 24 March 1963\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/630324-beatles-liverpool-empire_01.jpg\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a></div></figure></div><p>The Beatles’ setlist on this tour, in which they appeared on a bill with Tommy Roe and Chris Montez, was: <a href=\"/songs/love-me-do/\">‘Love Me Do’</a>, <a href=\"/songs/misery/\">‘Misery’</a>, <a href=\"/songs/a-taste-of-honey/\">‘A Taste Of Honey’</a>, <a href=\"/songs/do-you-want-to-know-a-secret/\">‘Do You Want To Know A Secret’</a>, <a href=\"/songs/please-please-me/\">‘Please Please Me’</a> and <a href=\"/songs/i-saw-her-standing-there/\">‘I Saw Her Standing There’</a>.</p>\n<!--[googlesitekit-end-of-content]--><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Page last updated:</strong> 25 January 2024</div></div></div><div class=\"on-this-day-wrapper\"><h3>Also on this day...</h3><ul><li>2012: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2012/03/24/paul-mccartney-live-rotterdam-ahoy-rotterdam-7/\">Paul McCartney live: Ahoy, Rotterdam, Netherlands</a></li><li>2010: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/2010/03/24/john-lennon-liverpool-celebrations-2010/\">Liverpool to host two-month tribute to John Lennon</a></li><li>1978: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1978/03/24/uk-single-release-with-a-little-luck-wings/\">UK single release: With A Little Luck by Wings</a></li><li>1975: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1975/03/24/launch-party-venus-and-mars-wings/\">Launch party for Venus And Mars by Wings</a></li><li>1975: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1975/03/24/mixing-venus-and-mars-reprise-wings/\">Mixing: Venus And Mars (Reprise) by Wings</a></li><li>1974: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1974/03/24/john-lennon-mick-jagger-jam-los-angeles/\">John Lennon and Mick Jagger jam in Los Angeles</a></li><li>1973: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1973/03/24/television-james-paul-mccartney-11/\">Television: James Paul McCartney</a></li><li>1969: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1969/03/24/john-lennon-and-yoko-ono-meet-salvador-dali/\">John Lennon and Yoko Ono meet Salvador Dalí</a></li><li>1966: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1966/03/24/the-beatles-attend-the-premiere-of-alfie/\">The Beatles attend the première of Alfie</a></li><li>1965: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1965/03/24/filming-help-23/\">Filming: Help!</a></li><li>1964: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1964/03/24/filming-a-hard-days-night-17/\">Filming: A Hard Day’s Night</a></li><li>1962: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1962/03/24/live-heswall-jazz-club-wirral/\">The Beatles live: Heswall Jazz Club, Wirral</a></li><li>1961: <a href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/1961/03/24/live-cavern-club-liverpool-14/\">The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (lunchtime)</a></li></ul><p>Want more? Visit the <a title=\"Day after day: the Beatles' history\" href=\"/history/\">Beatles history section</a>.</p></div><div class=\"gm-map\" style=\"position: relative;height: 390px; width: 100%;\"><iframe data-lazyloaded=\"1\" src=\"about:blank\" name=\"gm-map-1\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-src=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/?geo_mashup_content=render-map&amp;map_data_key=9e7da0aca388978022ff9e6b1c1f7873&amp;height=390&amp;width=100%&amp;add_overview_control=false&amp;zoom=16&amp;enable_street_view=false&amp;map_type=G_HYBRID_MAP&amp;name=gm-map-1&amp;object_id=3707&amp;map_content=single\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border: none; overflow: hidden;\" title=\"Geo Mashup Map\"></iframe></div>",
  "textContent": "A triumphant homecoming show for The Beatles, who gave a performance at the Empire Theatre. It was their first performance in the city in over a month, and came in the same week their debut album Please Please Me was released. \n\n\nThe Beatles’ setlist on this tour, in which they appeared on a bill with Tommy Roe and Chris Montez, was: ‘Love Me Do’, ‘Misery’, ‘A Taste Of Honey’, ‘Do You Want To Know A Secret’, ‘Please Please Me’ and ‘I Saw Her Standing There’.\nPage last updated: 25 January 2024Also on this day...2012: Paul McCartney live: Ahoy, Rotterdam, Netherlands2010: Liverpool to host two-month tribute to John Lennon1978: UK single release: With A Little Luck by Wings1975: Launch party for Venus And Mars by Wings1975: Mixing: Venus And Mars (Reprise) by Wings1974: John Lennon and Mick Jagger jam in Los Angeles1973: Television: James Paul McCartney1969: John Lennon and Yoko Ono meet Salvador Dalí1966: The Beatles attend the première of Alfie1965: Filming: Help!1964: Filming: A Hard Day’s Night1962: The Beatles live: Heswall Jazz Club, Wirral1961: The Beatles live: Cavern Club, Liverpool (lunchtime)Want more? Visit the Beatles history section.",
